Darkness.\n\nRADIOACTIVE, INC. invites you to the decaying, dangerous halls of a deserted nuclear research complex. Face your fears across 20 unique levels, each filled with new horrors, secrets, and challenges. Uncover the mysteries behind failed experiments, hidden agendas, and the feeling that something is always watching you… Are you brave enough to continue? \n\nFeatures:\n\n• \nRetro PS1-Style Graphics: Experience nostalgic 90s horror with lo-fi visuals, gritty textures, and unsettling lighting.\n\n• \n20 Distinct Levels: Each chapter presents new dangers, traps, puzzles, and scares. Navigate leaking reactor chambers, rotten laboratories, and forgotten offices.\n\n• \nSolo or Co-op Gameplay: Play alone for a pure horror experience or team up with friends to survive together.\n\n• \nSurvival and Escape: Hide from threats, collect clues, solve puzzles, and find your way out before it’s too late.\n\n• \nAtmospheric Soundtrack: Tense ambient sounds and immersive music ramp up the suspense with every step.\n\nWill You Dare to Escape?\n\nRADIOACTIVE, INC. opens the doors to a nightmare full of secrets. Can you escape the darkness, reach the end of all chapters, and reveal the truth behind the corporation?","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/99b9d059292d602d658256e9e0339e2e5fbdae4c/header.jpg?t=1772389509"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/306f439aff992f211b291452904e562159bf7470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772389509"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879670/b04f0355d7399bbb0fda2d2d09b6c0f6ba03478e/ss_b04f0355d7399bbb0fda2d2d09b6c0f6ba03478e.600x338.jpg?t=1772389509","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st